  "overview": {
   "type": "doc",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Redguard mercenary who fled a lost battle in Hammerfell, dumped his heavy armor and starts again near Falkreath. Spear and shield in light armor: One-Handed (spears use Sword & Spear Focus), Evasion and Block.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Javelins only to pull and bait, not for damage. Phalanx adds 15% damage with spears and javelins but 50% more damage taken from behind, so keep a wall at your back and never fight surrounded.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Shouts break a shield line: Lore of the Thu'um early, Shout Focus at 11. Agile and tanky, not unkillable.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
